1
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,733
In a bit I'll give you a bath.

2
00:00:24,706 --> 00:00:25,706
What?

3
00:00:27,333 --> 00:00:28,600
Xu Feiyu.

4
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,100
Mom!

5
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:31,900
How come you're back?

6
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,026
You've never come home
this late before.

7
00:00:36,633 --> 00:00:37,633
I…

8
00:00:42,933 --> 00:00:45,033
So you're Yong Qi's junior?

9
00:00:46,866 --> 00:00:47,266
Auntie

10
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,400
I'm Song Yi.

11
00:00:49,066 --> 00:00:51,166
I hear you live in Singapore.

12
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:52,666
What brings you here?

13
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,266
Surely not just to

14
00:00:54,267 --> 00:00:55,566
be our family's caregiver?

15
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,600
I…

16
00:00:57,933 --> 00:00:59,866
I just came to help Yong Qi out.

17
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:01,466
I was free anyway.

18
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,533
Both of you come and sit.

19
00:01:20,633 --> 00:01:21,766
You sit too.

20
00:01:31,933 --> 00:01:33,699
Xu Feiyu used to have

21
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,233
a skin contact allergy.

22
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,100
You know about it?

23
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:39,133
Yes

24
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,400
I know.

25
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,800
And now

26
00:01:42,633 --> 00:01:43,633
is it gone?

27
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
It's much better.

28
00:01:47,533 --> 00:01:48,800
Maybe I'm just

29
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:49,833
slow to react

30
00:01:49,933 --> 00:01:50,933
so

31
00:01:51,333 --> 00:01:52,933
he's not allergic to me.

32
00:02:11,866 --> 00:02:12,866
Song Yi.

33
00:02:13,766 --> 00:02:15,733
Thank you for looking after Xu Feiyu.

34
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,633
This

35
00:02:17,766 --> 00:02:20,432
is a tie clip I brought back from Germany.

36
00:02:20,433 --> 00:02:21,666
It looks quite nice.

37
00:02:21,933 --> 00:02:22,933
It's for you.

38
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,100
No thank you, Auntie.

39
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:27,165
I never wear suits.

40
00:02:27,166 --> 00:02:28,166
I'd never use it.

41
00:02:28,733 --> 00:02:30,765
Then take a look at these trinkets,

42
00:02:30,766 --> 00:02:32,266
see if there's one you like.

43
00:02:32,533 --> 00:02:34,032
Think of it as a little

44
00:02:34,033 --> 00:02:35,033
token from me.

45
00:02:49,333 --> 00:02:50,566
Pick this one.

46
00:02:51,733 --> 00:02:52,733
Thank you.

47
00:03:00,066 --> 00:03:01,832
You've had a hard few days.

48
00:03:01,833 --> 00:03:02,932
As for your fee

49
00:03:02,933 --> 00:03:04,499
I'll pay you double.

50
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,733
You're too kind, Auntie.

51
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,466
I only did what I should.

52
00:03:08,233 --> 00:03:08,800
Mom.

53
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:11,366
You could've told me you
were coming home first.

54
00:03:11,433 --> 00:03:13,400
Look what time you got home.

55
00:03:13,833 --> 00:03:16,300
Your eyes aren't healed.
You need more rest.

56
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:19,100
Go on.

57
00:03:19,266 --> 00:03:20,733
Go rest in your room.

58
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,400
Careful.

59
00:03:26,133 --> 00:03:27,200
All right.

60
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:29,733
I'll go to bed then.

61
00:03:58,700 --> 00:03:59,700
Song Yi.

62
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:03,100
Come here a moment.

63
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:22,833
Have a drink with me.

64
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,166
Yes.

65
00:04:26,166 --> 00:04:27,166
Auntie.

66
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,233
You remind me of a friend of mine.

67
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,966
He's in Singapore too.

68
00:04:46,733 --> 00:04:47,733
As it happens

69
00:04:47,966 --> 00:04:49,100
his surname is Song too.

70
00:04:51,066 --> 00:04:52,133
Is that so?

71
00:04:52,733 --> 00:04:54,200
Singapore is a big place.

72
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,000
We probably

73
00:04:56,366 --> 00:04:57,366
never met.

74
00:05:03,233 --> 00:05:05,100
Does Song Yang know you're here?

75
00:05:06,533 --> 00:05:07,999
Do you plan to go on

76
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,200
hiding it from Xu Feiyu?

77
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,833
Did Yong Qi tell you everything?

78
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,100
Yong Qi?

79
00:05:15,266 --> 00:05:16,900
She's not that obedient.

80
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,866
You probably don't remember.

81
00:05:19,133 --> 00:05:21,433
Ten years ago I went to Singapore.

82
00:05:21,666 --> 00:05:22,833
I saw you from afar.

83
00:05:23,333 --> 00:05:25,033
The day Song Yang left prison.

84
00:05:26,066 --> 00:05:27,366
You saw me?

85
00:05:27,933 --> 00:05:29,432
Back then

86
00:05:29,433 --> 00:05:30,733
you were still just

87
00:05:30,933 --> 00:05:32,766
a little crybaby.

88
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,100
But I remember your eyes.

89
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,000
On guard against everyone.

90
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:41,100
I know that look far too well.

91
00:05:42,633 --> 00:05:44,233
Just like Xu Feiyu's.

92
00:05:49,466 --> 00:05:50,500
Auntie Xu

93
00:05:51,833 --> 00:05:54,133
why did my old man leave without a word?

94
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:59,133
Is that what you came here for?

95
00:06:00,666 --> 00:06:02,700
That's one of the reasons, yes.

96
00:06:03,033 --> 00:06:04,300
That question

97
00:06:04,533 --> 00:06:06,133
has haunted me for years.

98
00:06:06,733 --> 00:06:08,433
I'm hoping you can answer it.

99
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:11,233
Is that a demand?

100
00:06:12,666 --> 00:06:13,800
It's a request.

101
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,900
My marriage to Song Yang

102
00:06:35,666 --> 00:06:37,266
was nothing but a deal.

103
00:06:40,133 --> 00:06:41,900
He gave me a child

104
00:06:42,233 --> 00:06:44,266
and I sent him to Singapore to study.

105
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:46,966
What I never expected

106
00:06:47,633 --> 00:06:49,566
was that the fool fell in love with me.

107
00:06:50,466 --> 00:06:51,566
And just like that

108
00:06:52,333 --> 00:06:54,300
we stayed tangled up for eleven years.

109
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,000
A deal?

110
00:06:56,133 --> 00:06:56,700
Yes.

111
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,366
It was just a deal.

112
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:00,500
So all these years

113
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,533
it was you who kept them apart.

114
00:07:02,666 --> 00:07:03,666
It was you

115
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:04,866
who denied them

116
00:07:04,867 --> 00:07:06,033
any news of each other?

117
00:07:06,166 --> 00:07:07,166
Yes.

118
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,800
It was me.

119
00:07:09,039 --> 00:07:10,339
You don't have to love my dad,

120
00:07:11,066 --> 00:07:13,233
but my dad has every right to love his son.

121
00:07:13,966 --> 00:07:15,733
You know nothing about the past.

122
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,332
Let alone understand it.

123
00:07:17,333 --> 00:07:17,733
Besides!

124
00:07:18,233 --> 00:07:20,533
You're in no position to judge me.

125
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,266
You turned Xu Feiyu into a bargaining chip.

126
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,033
All of this...

127
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,266
wasn't it you who caused it?

128
00:07:29,833 --> 00:07:31,100
Objectively speaking,

129
00:07:31,666 --> 00:07:33,265
if not for my past mistakes,

130
00:07:33,266 --> 00:07:34,966
there'd be no you, would there?

131
00:07:35,333 --> 00:07:36,333
I...

132
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,400
Song Yi.

133
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,133
Put your curiosity away.

134
00:07:40,866 --> 00:07:43,299
What you really need to understand

135
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:44,532
is that everything you do

136
00:07:44,533 --> 00:07:46,166
is hurting Xu Feiyu.

137
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,399
I never meant to hurt him.

138
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,666
You already have!

139
00:08:05,533 --> 00:08:06,533
Song Yi.

140
00:08:09,666 --> 00:08:10,666
Just go.

141
00:08:13,133 --> 00:08:14,933
Pretend none of this ever happened.

142
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:20,300
I won't say a word about you and Song Yang.

143
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:25,700
Is that a demand?

144
00:08:33,733 --> 00:08:34,733
This is a request.

145
00:08:52,333 --> 00:08:54,600
Xu Feiyu has a right to the truth.

146
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,066
And my dad has the right to choose.

147
00:08:58,300 --> 00:08:59,733
You owe them that.

148
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:02,166
And I owe them that too.

149
00:09:04,133 --> 00:09:05,166
Song Yi.

150
00:09:06,533 --> 00:09:07,866
Back then,

151
00:09:07,933 --> 00:09:09,266
you were still a child,

152
00:09:10,266 --> 00:09:11,800
just like Xu Feiyu.

153
00:09:13,133 --> 00:09:15,166
You couldn't choose anything.

154
00:09:15,633 --> 00:09:17,200
So you owe no one anything.

155
00:09:18,832 --> 00:09:19,832
It's just that...

156
00:09:20,433 --> 00:09:23,700
Xu Feiyu has suffered more than enough.

157
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:25,100
So please, don't

158
00:09:25,101 --> 00:09:26,999
drag him into something more dangerous.

159
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,000
All right?

160
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,365
I just think that he and my dad

161
00:09:31,366 --> 00:09:32,400
have suffered enough.

162
00:09:32,733 --> 00:09:34,933
You're a good kid at heart.

163
00:09:35,533 --> 00:09:36,766
Take my advice.

164
00:09:37,033 --> 00:09:38,533
Don't play with fire here.

165
00:09:39,933 --> 00:09:40,933
I promise you.

166
00:09:41,533 --> 00:09:42,533
After you leave,

167
00:09:42,966 --> 00:09:43,933
little by little,

168
00:09:43,934 --> 00:09:45,400
I'll tell him everything.

169
00:09:45,833 --> 00:09:46,833
Does that work?

170
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,033
Do you think it'll be that easy?

171
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:52,300
My dad's been gone all these years,

172
00:09:52,866 --> 00:09:55,733
Xu Feiyu still thinks there's
rats in the house.

173
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,800
Could he really take that?

174
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,099
Xu Feiyu.

175
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,400
Your mom's still upstairs.

176
00:10:51,433 --> 00:10:52,966
Then we'll keep it down.

177
00:11:01,533 --> 00:11:02,533
What's wrong?

178
00:11:06,866 --> 00:11:09,606
I
might have to leave.

179
00:11:09,966 --> 00:11:10,966
What happened?

180
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,733
Did my mom say something to you?

181
00:11:15,633 --> 00:11:16,633
No.

182
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,400
She's very kind.

183
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:21,400
Then why leave so suddenly?

184
00:11:21,866 --> 00:11:23,266
I haven't even seen your face.

185
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,766
I'm only a temporary carer.

186
00:11:30,066 --> 00:11:31,133
Your mom's back now.

187
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,766
No real reason for me to stay.

188
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:36,166
Then at least

189
00:11:36,167 --> 00:11:37,633
wait till my bandages come off.

190
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:41,000
I want you to be the first person I see.

191
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,866
I want to know

192
00:11:47,933 --> 00:11:49,966
if you look the way I imagined.

193
00:11:59,233 --> 00:12:00,766
You shouldn't get your hopes up.

194
00:12:01,766 --> 00:12:02,766
Probably

195
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:04,133
I'd disappoint you.

196
00:12:05,833 --> 00:12:06,833
Why?

197
00:12:18,733 --> 00:12:19,733
Song Yi.

198
00:12:21,333 --> 00:12:21,833
Auntie.

199
00:12:21,966 --> 00:12:22,966
It's getting late.

200
00:12:23,533 --> 00:12:24,933
Go rest in the guest room.

201
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,600
I'll take the couch.

202
00:12:27,433 --> 00:12:28,433
He might get up

203
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:30,300
during the night.

204
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,300
All right.

205
00:14:25,100 --> 00:14:26,266
Your mom's still here.

206
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:27,733
She could come down anytime.

207
00:14:29,166 --> 00:14:30,166
Forget about her.

208
00:14:30,766 --> 00:14:33,299
She just flew all the way back from abroad.

209
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:34,700
She'll be out cold.

210
00:14:56,333 --> 00:14:57,333
Mm…

211
00:15:50,733 --> 00:15:51,733
Mm.

212
00:16:08,433 --> 00:16:09,466
Xu Feiyu!

213
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:57,700
Okay, okay.

214
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:58,900
Enough.

215
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:00,500
No…

216
00:17:00,633 --> 00:17:01,633
Ah!

217
00:17:02,733 --> 00:17:03,733
Ah!

218
00:17:06,266 --> 00:17:07,266
Xu Feiyu.

219
00:17:07,766 --> 00:17:09,300
Your mom's going to hear us.

220
00:17:10,866 --> 00:17:13,066
I'll admit I lost control a little.

221
00:17:14,166 --> 00:17:16,000
I do, every time I'm near you.

222
00:17:17,666 --> 00:17:19,033
Then reign it in a little.

223
00:17:20,566 --> 00:17:22,133
I can't hold back anymore.

224
00:17:22,266 --> 00:17:22,733
Mm.

225
00:17:22,833 --> 00:17:23,466
Mm…

226
00:17:23,666 --> 00:17:24,666
Just hold on.

227
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,600
Ah!

228
00:17:27,733 --> 00:17:28,733
Mm.

229
00:17:29,033 --> 00:17:30,033
Mmm…

230
00:17:30,566 --> 00:17:31,566
Mm.

231
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,000
Mm… mm.

232
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:54,700
Okay.

233
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:56,100
Enough for tonight.

234
00:17:56,766 --> 00:17:57,766
Go to sleep.

235
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,400
Song Yi.

236
00:18:01,633 --> 00:18:04,100
Will you wait for the day
my bandages come off?

237
00:18:06,633 --> 00:18:08,066
Don't be silly.

238
00:18:09,300 --> 00:18:10,565
When my bandages come off,

239
00:18:10,566 --> 00:18:12,133
I'm going to see you.

240
00:18:13,166 --> 00:18:14,166
That way,

241
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:15,766
even if we're apart,

242
00:18:16,733 --> 00:18:19,033
I'll remember your face forever.

243
00:18:21,366 --> 00:18:22,366
Okay.

244
00:18:23,066 --> 00:18:24,066
Don't think so much.

245
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:25,600
Let's sleep.

246
00:18:26,066 --> 00:18:27,066
Mm.
